Recommended integration regression:
- select core/doctor/disk-space together with one isolated plugin check;
- give source env and private plugin snapshot different OPENCLAW_STATE_DIR values;
- assert disk-space probes the source/operator directory;
- assert the plugin check remains inside its private state snapshot;
- preserve source SQLite bytes before/after.

Compatibility:
- no config key change;
- no persisted schema change;
- no migration/backfill;
- noteDiskSpace() keeps its existing ambient process.env behavior;
- only the structured Doctor health-check path gains explicit source-env ownership.

